  "notes": "WRITING:\nおさめる is written with different kanji by meaning:\n- {収|おさ}める: to put away, store, contain; to obtain or achieve (this entry)\n- ⟦{納|おさ}める→納める：02280_osameru⟧: to pay (taxes, fees), deliver, dedicate (⟦{税金|ぜいきん}→税金：03308_zeikin⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{納|おさ}める→納める：02280_osameru⟧)\n- ⟦{治|おさ}める→治める：02462_osameru⟧: to govern, rule; to calm\n- ⟦{修|おさ}める→修める：27839_osameru⟧: to study, master\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ⟦{成功|せいこう}→成功：02638_seikou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{収|おさ}める: to achieve success\n- ⟦{勝利|しょうり}→勝利：11795_shouri⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{収|おさ}める: to win victory\n- ⟦{成果|せいか}→成果：06745_seika⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{収|おさ}める: to produce results\n- ⟦{鞘|さや}→鞘：14698_saya⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{収|おさ}める: to sheathe (a sword)\n- ⟦{写真|しゃしん}→写真：00753_shashin⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{収|おさ}める: to capture in a photo\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive (〜⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{収|おさ}める); the intransitive partner is ⟦{収|おさ}まる→収まる：11858_osamaru⟧ (to fit, be contained).\n\nASPECT (ている):\nIn the \"achieve\" sense, {収|おさ}めて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ describes a lasting result: ⟦{大|おお}きな→大きな：02849_ookina⟧⟦{成功|せいこう}→成功：02638_seikou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{収|おさ}めて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ means \"has achieved great success\", not \"is in the process of succeeding\".",
